  "description": "The Vantage 2.0 levels up the performance with upgraded gearing, wheelset, and cranks over the 1.0.\nThe 6061 hydroformed alloy frame with internal headset and cables paired to a carbon aero through axle fork cuts a mean silhouette to match the high end performance.\nFast and accurate gear changes are guaranteed by Shimano Tiagra STI shifters and matched to Tektro disc brakes they give plenty of stopping power in all weathers. Drivetrain comprises of a compact 50/34t forged alloy crankset with external bottom bracket matched to a 11-32t making climbs a breeze and the flats fast. 20 speeds give both fantastic range a close matched ratios to keep that cadence consistent.\nMaxxis M225 28c tyres give enhanced grip and cushioning to give confident road holding. Mounted on Alex ATD470 tubeless compatible wheels you’ll notice the impressive acceleration and climbing ability of the wheelset. The Vantage is a fast, reliable, all season road bike at a great price!",
